<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>İletişim | Öz Spor & Outdoor</title>
<meta name="description" content="Öz Spor & Outdoor iletişim bilgileri, adres, telefon ve e-posta.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/default-product.png">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root { --black: #0a0a0a; --white: #f5f5f0; --accent: #d4ff00; --gray-400: #999990; --gray-600: #555550; }
  body { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; background: var(--black); color: var(--white); min-height: 100vh; }
  nav { height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 28px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a; }
  .nav-logo { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
  .nav-back { color: var(--gray-400); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
  .nav-back:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 28px 80px; }
  .contact-container h1 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 52px; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .contact-sub { color: var(--gray-400); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 60px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  .contact-card { background: #111; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px 28px; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
  .contact-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-card-icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .contact-card-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .contact-card-value { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-card-value a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }
  .contact-card-value a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-card-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray-400); margin-top: 8px; }
  .btn-whatsapp { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #25D366; color: #fff; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .btn-whatsapp:hover { background: #128C7E; }
  .hours-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px; }
  .hours-table td { padding: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ccc; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
  .hours-table td:last-child { text-align: right; color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }
  .section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .legal-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
  .legal-links a { color: var(--gray-400); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .legal-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .legal-footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #222; font-size: 10px; color: var(--gray-600); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Öz Spor <span>&</span> Outdoor</a>
  <a href="/" class="nav-back">← Ana Sayfa</a>
</nav>
<div class="contact-container">
  <h1>İletişim</h1>
  <p class="contact-sub">Atatürk Mah. Özgürlük Sok. No:1/E, Gerze / Sinop — Sorularınız için buradayız</p>

  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="contact-card-icon">📍</div>
      <div class="contact-card-title">Adres</div>
      <div class="contact-card-value">
        Öz Spor ve Outdoor<br>
        Atatürk Mahallesi Özgürlük Sokak<br>
        No: 1/E, Gerze / Sinop<br>
        Türkiye
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="contact-card-icon">📞</div>
      <div class="contact-card-title">Telefon</div>
      <div class="contact-card-value">
        <a href="tel:+905078707550">+90 507 870 75 50</a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card-note">Pazartesi – Cumartesi, 09:00–18:00</div>
      <br>
      <a href="https://wa.me/905078707550" class="btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        💬 WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="contact-card-icon">✉️</div>
      <div class="contact-card-title">E-posta</div>
      <div class="contact-card-value">
        <a href="mailto:info@ozsporoutdoor.com">info@ozsporoutdoor.com</a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card-note">Genellikle 24 saat içinde yanıt verilir.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="contact-card-icon">🕐</div>
      <div class="contact-card-title">Çalışma Saatleri</div>
      <table class="hours-table">
        <tr><td>Pazartesi – Cuma</td><td>09:00 – 18:00</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cumartesi</td><td>09:00 – 14:00</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Pazar</td><td>Kapalı</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 48px;">
    <div class="section-title">Yasal Bilgiler</div>
    <div class="legal-links">
      <a href="/teslimat">Teslimat Koşulları</a>
      <a href="/satis-politikasi">Satış Politikası</a>
      <a href="/refund-policy">İptal ve İade</a>
      <a href="/terms">Kullanım Koşulları</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Gizlilik Politikası</a>
      <a href="/kvkk">KVKK Aydınlatma</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="legal-footer">&copy; 2026 Öz Spor ve Outdoor. Tüm Hakları Saklıdır.</div>
</body>
</html>
